Description:

JMAP /query, /queryChanges and SearchSnippet/get return only the
arguments RFC 8620 defines, and `total` only when `calculateTotal` is set.


Documentation:

RFC 8620 sections 5.5 and 5.6.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that read `total` must set `calculateTotal: true`.  Clients that
read the echoed arguments, including result references to `/filter`,
must use the values from their own request instead.


GitHub issue:

None.
